{"version":1,"content":"<p>特斯拉無人駕駛車輛Cybercab首批交付臨近。最新航拍圖顯示，待發運的量產車車頂均裝有方形面板，面板位置與官方公佈的星鏈集成位置吻合。特斯拉自7月起已多次公開表示Cybercab將集成星鏈服務。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587298.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T16:24:27.112176+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T16:06:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:17:35.765399+00:00","content_hash":"d8e29232417d3b287e4ff90b0ce3d939497f0b217250bfb0b32d1094477eb40b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}